        "created_at": "2018-10-23T00:22:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually looked up the answer to my second question and got excited when I saw the errata, only to find that it didn't answer my question.&nbsp; Thanks, that explains a lot.</p>\n<p>And, of course, if I'd bothered to look at all the spirits, I'd have seen Dreams, which makes the answer to the fear question obvious.</p>\n<p>I'm aware of the errata pack--hoping I can get it as part of the Kickstarter.</p>",
